    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "`validate` is a deterministic, read-only validation surface for repeated command families that currently run through bash.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "It answers:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- did the lane pass? - what failed? - is the failure code, environment, or workspace state? - is the patch or lane eligible for promotion?",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "It is not a general shell wrapper.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
